# Responsive Web Design

Build adaptive interfaces using modern CSS techniques for all screen sizes.

## Mobile-First Media Queries

```css
/* Base: Mobile (320px+) */
.container {
  padding: 1rem;
}

/* Tablet (640px+) */
@media (min-width: 640px) {
  .container {
    padding: 2rem;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
}

/* Desktop (1024px+) */
@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  .container {
